text Pitching practice begins.
text I can't believe how high her pitches arc. They're like high underhand volleyball serves.
text Still, they manage to brush against the strike zone. She may be more athletically-inclined than I expected.
text She just doesn't have any power, that's all.
text The game is restarted.
