text After pausing for a moment, she throws the ball.
text *Flutter*
text The ball is annoyingly slow.
text The batter waits for it patiently, and...
text *CLANK*
text Swings hard at it.
text The ball flies high into the air, passing above Furukawa's head and falling into shallow center field.
