text I'm leading our offense off this inning.
text I take it and stand in the batter's box.
text @[Tomoya]
text (What am I supposed to do with my shoulder like this?)
text All I can think of doing is making contact and having the ball land between the infield and outfield.
text But I'm up against a control pitcher. Could an amateur like me get a hit off of him?
text I look for a breaking ball from the first pitch.
text It's a big curveball.
text I swing, but miss it completely.
text @[Tomoya]
text (I must look really lame swinging like this.)
text Caught up in that thought, I whiff the second pitch.
text I watch as the third pitch, a high fastball, goes by me.
